562	    /**
563	     * Rejects the request when the owner's city already contains {@link #MAX_OWNERS_PER_CITY} or more
564	     * owners, comparing city names case-insensitively. Callers reach this only once {@code city} has
565	     * been validated non-blank.
566	     *
567	     * @param city the incoming owner's city (already validated non-blank)
568	     * @throws CityAtCapacityException if the city is already at or above its owner capacity
